This changes the in-game chat in coop mode to display certain characters as custom emojis
NOTE: this is mainly here as a demonstration of what can be done, it is not fully complete. 

Installation:
1. download the file and follow installation instructions in the README file
2. inside the "portal2_dlc3" folder is a file titled "Universemoji.vfont". Copy the file, and paste it inside "Portal 2/platform/vgui/fonts/"

Uninstallation:
1. delete the "Universemoji.vfont" file from "Portal 2/platform/vgui/fonts/"
2. move the "portal2_dlc#" folder out of your Portal 2 directory

Extra Notes:
Both the installation and deletion instructions are included inside the "portal2_dlc3" folder, along with a copy of "Universemoji.vfont".
It is important to copy and paste the vfont file instead of moving it due to ease of removal and installation. You can drag it, but it'll take longer.
If you plan on submitting a speedrun, not removing "Universemoji.vfont" from your game files will get your run flagged and potentially invalidated.
If you choose to deactivate the mod and don't plan on submitting a speedrun, you do not have to delete "Universemoji.vfont".
